/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (The representatives of Participatie Keuken were enthusiastic to work with us. On the introduction day and over the course of the project, they helped us get to know the organization, how they operate, and the challenges they face. Communication was achieved in person at organized meetings and through email, through which we obtained valuable information like products that are often in excess, the main languages spoken in the neighborhood, and the most important stakeholders for this problem. Together, we successfully defined the problem and came up with desired outcomes and deliverables. Our group members also volunteered at Participatie Keuken, which was a positive experience.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
